  <main id="main">

    <!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
    <section class="page-head industry-head">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">How we work</span>
        <h1>We prove it works on your real work <em>before you pay for the full build.</em></h1>
        <p class="lead hero__say">Map and measure the work, try a small version on real cases, then build it, train your team and report the time saved every month. <b>You can stop after any step.</b></p>
        <div class="btn-row page-head__cta">
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary btn--large" data-review-open>Tell us what&rsquo;s slowing you down</button>
          <a href="#score" class="btn btn--ghost btn--large">Score an opportunity</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- ============ THREE STEPS ============ -->
    <section class="section section--tint" id="steps" aria-labelledby="stTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">At a glance</span>
          <h2 id="stTitle">Three steps, and a way out after each one.</h2>
        </div>
        <ol class="three reveal">
          <li><span class="three__n">1</span><b>Find</b><p>We look at how the work is done today, measure it, and say what&rsquo;s worth automating.</p><span class="three__meta">1&ndash;2 weeks · <span data-zar="15000">R15,000</span></span><span class="three__stop">You can stop here, and keep the map</span></li>
          <li><span class="three__n">2</span><b>Prove</b><p>A small version works on real cases, and we measure the time it saves.</p><span class="three__meta">2&ndash;4 weeks · from <span data-zar="35000">R35,000</span></span><span class="three__stop">You can stop here if it doesn&rsquo;t pay</span></li>
          <li><span class="three__n">3</span><b>Build and run</b><p>Connected to your systems, your team trained, and a report on the time saved every month.</p><span class="three__meta">from <span data-zar="85000">R85,000</span>, then from <span data-zar="7500">R7,500</span> a month</span><span class="three__stop">Month to month after 3 months</span></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ PHASES ============ -->
    <section class="section" id="phases" aria-labelledby="phTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">In detail</span>
          <h2 id="phTitle">What happens, what you get, and what we need from you.</h2>
        </div>
        <ol class="mphases">
          <li class="mphase reveal"><span class="mphase__n">01</span><div><h3>We look at how the work is done today <small>Discovery</small></h3><p>We map the <b>people</b>, <b>processes</b>, <b>software</b>, <b>data</b>, <b>bottlenecks</b>, <b>repetitive work</b> and <b>decision points</b>. Then we measure the baseline: how long the work takes today, how often, and what it costs.</p><p class="mphase__out">You get: a process map and baseline numbers.</p><p class="mphase__you"><b>Your part:</b> Two or three one-hour sessions, and examples of the work.</p></div><span class="mphase__tag">Find</span></li>
          <li class="mphase reveal"><span class="mphase__n">02</span><div><h3>We score what&rsquo;s worth automating <small>Opportunity mapping</small></h3><p>Every opportunity we find is scored on six factors and ranked. Some will be quick wins, some need the data fixed first, some aren&rsquo;t worth it. We say which.</p><p class="mphase__out">You get: a scored opportunity map and a recommended first build.</p><p class="mphase__you"><b>Your part:</b> An hour to go through the list with us and pick the first one.</p></div><span class="mphase__tag">Find</span></li>
          <li class="mphase reveal"><span class="mphase__n">03</span><div><h3>We try a small version on real work <small>Proof of concept</small></h3><p>We build the smallest useful version and put it to work on real cases with the people who&rsquo;ll use it. Not a demo: a working slice.</p><p class="mphase__out">You get: a working system on real work.</p><p class="mphase__you"><b>Your part:</b> A weekly 30-minute check-in, and someone testing it on real cases.</p></div><span class="mphase__tag">Prove</span></li>
          <li class="mphase reveal"><span class="mphase__n">04</span><div><h3>We check the time it saved <small>ROI validation</small></h3><p>Before vs after, on the same measure. If the number moved, we go to production. If it didn&rsquo;t, we adjust or stop &mdash; and you haven&rsquo;t paid for a full build that doesn&rsquo;t work.</p><p class="mphase__out">You get: a measured result and a go / adjust / stop decision.</p><p class="mphase__you"><b>Your part:</b> A 30-minute review to decide: go, adjust or stop.</p></div><span class="mphase__tag">Prove</span></li>
          <li class="mphase reveal"><span class="mphase__n">05</span><div><h3>We build it properly into your systems <small>Production</small></h3><p>We integrate it properly: your real software, permissions, logging, error handling, and a safe fallback for when a model or service misbehaves.</p><p class="mphase__out">You get: a production system and its runbook.</p><p class="mphase__you"><b>Your part:</b> Access to the systems it connects to, and someone to sign it off.</p></div><span class="mphase__tag">Build and run</span></li>
          <li class="mphase reveal"><span class="mphase__n">06</span><div><h3>We train your team <small>Adoption</small></h3><p>We train the people who use it and adjust the system to how they actually work. A system nobody uses saves nothing.</p><p class="mphase__out">You get: a trained team, with usage tracked.</p><p class="mphase__you"><b>Your part:</b> One session per team that uses it.</p></div><span class="mphase__tag">Build and run</span></li>
          <li class="mphase reveal"><span class="mphase__n">07</span><div><h3>We keep it working, and make it better <small>Optimisation</small></h3><p>We monitor it, test its accuracy, keep it secure, tune the workflow and add integrations as you grow. Every month you get a report that leads with the result.</p><p class="mphase__out">You get: a monthly ROI report and a system that improves.</p><p class="mphase__you"><b>Your part:</b> Read the monthly report. Partner plans add a monthly review call.</p></div><span class="mphase__tag">Build and run</span></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ SCORER ============ -->
    <section class="section section--tint" id="score" aria-labelledby="scTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head section__head--center reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Try it on your own ideas</span>
          <h2 id="scTitle">Score an opportunity.</h2>
          <p>The same six questions we use in discovery. Score a few of your own ideas and see which one to build first. Not sure? Name the task and leave the rest; we&rsquo;ll score it properly in discovery.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="opp reveal" data-opp>
          <div class="opp__form">
            <label class="opp__name"><span>The opportunity</span><input type="text" name="name" maxlength="60" placeholder="e.g. Prepare replies to quote requests" /></label>
            <label class="roi__field"><span>How much time would it save?</span><output data-opp-out="time">7</output><input type="range" name="time" min="0" max="10" value="7" /></label>
            <label class="roi__field"><span>Could it bring in more money?</span><output data-opp-out="revenue">5</output><input type="range" name="revenue" min="0" max="10" value="5" /></label>
            <label class="roi__field"><span>How hard do you think it is to build? <small>(higher = harder)</small></span><output data-opp-out="difficulty">4</output><input type="range" name="difficulty" min="0" max="10" value="4" /></label>
            <label class="roi__field"><span>Is the information it needs easy to get?</span><output data-opp-out="data">7</output><input type="range" name="data" min="0" max="10" value="7" /></label>
            <label class="roi__field"><span>How bad would a mistake be? <small>(higher = worse)</small></span><output data-opp-out="risk">3</output><input type="range" name="risk" min="0" max="10" value="3" /></label>
            <label class="roi__field"><span>Will the team actually use it?</span><output data-opp-out="adoption">7</output><input type="range" name="adoption" min="0" max="10" value="7" /></label>
          </div>
          <div class="opp__out" aria-live="polite">
            <div class="opp__dial" style="--s:0"><b data-opp-score>0</b><span>/ 100</span></div>
            <p class="opp__band" data-opp-band></p>
            <p class="opp__gate" data-opp-gate hidden></p>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost btn--full" data-opp-add>Add to my list</button>
            <ol class="opp__list" data-opp-list></ol>
            <p class="tiny muted">Score = 2.5·Time + 1.5·Revenue + 1.5·Data + 1.5·Adoption + 1.5·(10 − Difficulty) + 1.5·(10 − Risk). Data ≤ 3 means fix the data first; risk ≥ 8 means a person approves every output.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <form class="sendme reveal" data-sendme="opp" novalidate>
          <p class="sendme__t">Email me my scores, highest first.</p>
          <div class="sendme__row">
            <input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="you@company.com" aria-label="Your email address" />
            <input type="text" name="business" autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Business (optional)" aria-label="Business name (optional)" />
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary btn--small">Email it to me</button>
          </div>
          <input type="text" name="_gotcha" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;opacity:0" />
          <p class="tiny muted sendme__msg" data-sendme-msg aria-live="polite">We&rsquo;ll send it once and may follow up once. <a class="inline-link" href="privacy">Privacy</a></p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ MEASUREMENT ============ -->
    <section class="section" id="measure" aria-labelledby="msTitle">
      <div class="container split">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">How we measure ROI</span>
          <h2 id="msTitle">A baseline first. The same measure after. A report every month.</h2>
          <p class="lead">We don&rsquo;t build anything until the number we&rsquo;re improving is written down, with how it was measured. After go-live we measure it the same way, and that&rsquo;s the number in your report.</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="mlist reveal">
          <li><b>Hours saved a month</b><span>(minutes before − minutes after) × items a month ÷ 60</span></li>
          <li><b>Value of those hours</b><span>hours × loaded hourly cost (salary × 1.3 ÷ 173, or your own figure)</span></li>
          <li><b>Payback</b><span>implementation ÷ (monthly value − operations fee)</span></li>
          <li><b>Revenue effects</b><span>reported separately, and only when measured &mdash; never quietly added</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="small muted reveal mlist__ex">Example: 3 people spending 5 hours a week on it, with 60% taken over, get about 39 hours a month back.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ REUSE ============ -->
    <section class="section section--dark" aria-labelledby="reTitle">
      <div class="container trust">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">Why it gets better</span>
          <h2 id="reTitle">Every job makes the next one faster.</h2>
          <blockquote>Each system we build leaves something reusable: an integration, an evaluation set, a process map for that industry. <em>The next client in that industry starts further ahead.</em></blockquote>
        </div>
        <ul class="trust__points reveal">
          <li><strong>Faster delivery</strong><span>Proven components instead of starting from scratch.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Fewer surprises</strong><span>We&rsquo;ve seen where that process breaks before.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Better results</strong><span>Every measured result sharpens the next estimate.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Model-independent</strong><span>When a better model arrives, your system gets it.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ CTA ============ -->
    <section class="cta" aria-labelledby="ctaTitle">
      <div class="container cta__inner reveal">
        <span class="cta__services">Find · Prove · Build and run</span>
        <h2 id="ctaTitle">Start with a free 30-minute review.</h2>
        <p>We hear the problem and tell you honestly whether AI is the answer. If it is, the Find step comes next, at a fixed price.</p>
        <div class="btn-row btn-row--center">
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--light btn--large" data-review-open>Tell us what&rsquo;s slowing you down</button>
          <a href="pricing" class="btn btn--ghost-light btn--large">Pricing &amp; support</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
